  "keyFeatures": [
    "Fully-typed accessor tree generated at type-check time from your template (e.g. data.Coins.Increment(50))",
    "Automatic schema-compressed replication to clients over a pluggable transport with no RemoteEvents to wire up",
    "Built-in leaderboards, gifting, monetization, and player-to-player exchanges",
    "Fail-closed session locking built on ProfileStore with migrations, wipe guard, and version history",
    "Scribe.Big for arbitrarily large numbers with full arithmetic and leaderboard support",
    "Containers: ArrayOf, DictOf, MapOf, SetOf, and Flags with per-element typing and size caps",
    "Optional add-ons: ScribeTelemetry (Discord webhook diagnostics), ScribeLeaderstats, and UI adapters for Vide, React, and Fusion",
    "roblox-ts support via @rbxts/scribe with inferred schema types"
  ],
